#: about/aboutpage.cpp:68 about/aboutpage.cpp:99
msgid "Plan is a Project Planning and Management application."
msgstr "Plan je alat za vođenje i upravljanje projektima"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:69
msgid "Welcome to Plan."
msgstr "Dobrodošli u Plan."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:70
msgid ""
"These introductory pages should give you an idea of how to use Plan and what "
"you can use it for."
msgstr ""
"Ove uvodne strane vam daju ideju kako koristi Plan i za šta ga možete "
"koristiti."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:71
msgid "A short introduction."
msgstr "Kratka uputa."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:72
msgid "Tips on how to manipulate and inspect data."
msgstr "Upute kako manipulirati i pregledavati podatke."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:73
msgid "A small tutorial to get you started."
msgstr "Kratki tutorijal kako možete krenuti."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<em>Note:</em> To view these pages when you are in other parts of Plan, "
"choose the menu option <em>Help ->  Introduction to Plan</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Napomena:</em> Da vidite ove strane kada ste u drugim dijelovima "
"programa Plan, Odaberite opciju menija <em>Pomoć ->  Uvod u  Plan</em>."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:101
msgid ""
"Plan is intended for managing moderately large projects with multiple "
"resources. To enable you to model your project adequately, Plan offers "
"different types of task dependencies and timing constraints. Usually you "
"will define your tasks, estimate the effort needed to perform each task, "
"allocate resources and then schedule the project according to the dependency "
"network and resource availability.<p>You can find more information in the <a "
"href=\"help:plan\">documentation</a> or online at <a href=\"http://www."
"calligra.org/plan\">http://www.calligra.org/plan</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"Plan je namijenjen za upravljanje umjereno velikim projektima s više "
"resursa. DA biste modelirali vaš projekt adekvatno, Plan pruža razne vrste "
"ovisnosti zadataka i vremenskih ograničenja. Obično definišete zadatke, "
"procjenite trud potreban za obavljanje svakog, dodijelite resurse i "
"rasporedite projetk prema mreži zavisnosti i dostupnosti resursa.<p>Više "
"informacija možete naći u <a href=\"help:plan\">dokumentaciji</a> ili mrežno "
"na <a href=\"http://www.calligra.org/plan\">http://www.calligra.org/plan</"
"a></p>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:106
msgid "Next: Tips"
msgstr "Sljedeće: Upute"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:145
msgid "Editing tips."
msgstr "Uređivanje uputa."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<br/><b>To</b> edit project data, different views and editors can be "
"selected in the View Selector docker.<br/><b>The</b> views are generally "
"used to inspect data after the project has been scheduled. No data will "
"appear in the views if the project has not been scheduled. Scheduling is "
"done in the Schedules editor.<br/><b>You</b> can edit attributes in the "
"various editors by selecting the item you want to edit (doubleclick or press "
"F2), or open a dialog using the context menu.</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<br/><b>Da</b> uredite projektne podatke, možete odabrati različite editore "
"i poglede iz dokera za pogled selektora.<br/><b>A</b> pogledi se koriste za "
"pregled podataka nakon što je projekat raspoređen, Poidaci se neće pojaciti "
"u pogledima ako projekt nije raaspoređen. Raspoređivanja se obavljaju u "
"uređivaču raspoređivanja.<br/><b>Vi</b> možete urediti atribute raznim "
"uređivačima ako izaberete stavku koju želite uređivati (duplim klikom ili "
"pritiskom naF2),ili otvorite dijalog koristeći kontekstni meni.</ul>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:153
msgid "Next: Create a simple project"
msgstr "Sljedeće: Napravite jednostavni projekat"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:188
msgid "Create the simplest project ever."
msgstr "Napravite najjednostavniji projekat ikada."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:190
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:<ul><li>Create a task by "
"selecting <em>Add Task</em> in the toolbar.</li><li>Set <em>Type</em> to "
"<em>Duration</em>.</li><li>Set <em>Estimate</em> to <em>8 hours</em>.</"
"li><li>Set <em>Constraint</em> to <em>As Soon As Possible</em>.</li></"
"ul>Select the schedules editor <em>Editors->Schedules</em>:<ul><li>Create a "
"schedule by selecting <em>Add Schedule</em> in the toolbar.</"
"li><li>Calculate the schedule by selecting <em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar."
"</li></ul>The task should now have been scheduled to start %1 with a "
"duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the Gantt chart "
"<em>Views->Gantt</em>."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite editor zadatka <em>Uređivači->Zadaci</em>:<ul><li>Kreirajte "
"zadatak izborom <em>Dodaj zadatak</em> u alatnoj traci.</li><li>Postavite "
"<em>tip</em> na <em>Trajanje</em>.</li><li>Postavite <em>Trajanje</em> na "
"<em>8 sati</em>.</li><li>Postavite <em>Ograničenje</em> na <em>što prije "
"moguće</em>.</li></ul>Odaberite uređivač rasporeda <em>Uređivači->Rasporedi</"
"em>:<ul><li>Kreirajte raspored izborom <em>Dodaj raspored </em> u alatnoj "
"traci.</li><li>Izračunajte raspored izborom <em>računaj</em> u alatnoj traci."
"</li></ul>Zadatak se treba rasporediti da počne %1 s trajanjem 8 sati. To "
"možete provjeriti izborom gantt dijagrama <em>Pogledi->Gantt</em>."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:206
msgid "Next: Resource allocation"
msgstr "Sljedeće: Resursna alokacija"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:217
msgid "Allocate a resource to the task."
msgstr "Alocirajte resurs za zadatak."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:219
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:<ul><li>Enter a name (e.g. "
"'John') in the <em>Allocation</em> column. (Plan will automatically create a "
"resource with name 'John' under resource group 'Resources'.</li><li>Set "
"<em>Type</em> to <em>Effort</em>.</li></ul>Now you need to schedule the "
"project again with the new allocation:<br/>Select the schedules editor "
"<em>Editors->Schedules</em> and calculate the schedule by selecting "
"<em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar.<p>The task should be scheduled to start "
"%1 with a duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the Gantt "
"chart <em>Views->Gantt</em>.<p>"
msgstr ""
"Odaberite uređivač zadataka <em>Uređivači->Zadaci</em>:<ul><li>Unesite ime "
"(npr. 'Jusuf') u <em>Alokacija</em> koloni. (Plan će automatski stvoriti "
"resurs s imenom 'Jusuf' pod resurs grupe 'Resources'.</li><li>Postavite "
"<em>Tip</em> na <em>Trud</em>.</li></ul>Sada trebate rasporediti projekt "
"opet s novom dodjelom:<br/>Odaberite uređivač rasporeda <em>Uređivači-"
">Rasporedi</em> i izračunajte rasproed izborom <em>Računaj</em> u alatnoj "
"traci.<p>Zadatak se treba rasporediti da počne u %1 sa trajanjem 8 sati. To "
"možete provjeriti izborom gantt dijagrama <em>Pogledi->Gantt</em>.<p>"

